cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this code, please cite it as below."
title: "Patient-level vs image-level data splitting in breast ultrasound lesion segmentation"
authors:
  - family-names: "Khodabandeh Yalabadi"
    given-names: "Sara"
repository-code: "https://github.com/sarakhodabandeh/Medical-image-segmentation-research"
license: MIT
abstract: >-
  Code for a paired evaluation of image-level and patient-level data splitting for breast
  ultrasound lesion segmentation and false-positive predictions on normal images, using a
  U-Net and the BUS-UCLM dataset.
keywords:
  - breast ultrasound
  - medical image segmentation
  - U-Net
  - data leakage
  - patient-level data splitting
